sequenceDiagram
    participant Analyst
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as FastAPI API
    participant Orchestrator as TaskOrchestrator
    participant Agent as Specialist Agent
    participant Cosmos as Cosmos DB

    Analyst->>UI: Submit research objective & ticker
    UI->>API: POST /api/input_task
    API->>Orchestrator: create_plan_from_objective
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Run MAF planner (ReAct)
    Orchestrator->>Cosmos: Store session, plan, steps
    Orchestrator-->>API: Plan with pending approvals
    API-->>UI: Render plan & steps
    loop Analyst approvals
        Analyst->>UI: Approve/Reject step
        UI->>API: POST /api/approve_step
        API->>Orchestrator: update_step_status
        Orchestrator->>Cosmos: Update step state
    end
    Orchestrator->>Agent: Execute approved step
    Agent->>Agent: Gather data (MCP, FMP, SEC) & reason via Azure OpenAI
    Agent-->>Orchestrator: Step result / artifact
    Orchestrator->>Cosmos: Persist messages & artifacts
    Orchestrator-->>API: Stream status update
    API-->>UI: Update live plan view
    UI-->>Analyst: Final brief & downloadable artifacts